<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Student Services - MRU</title>
<style>
:root{--main:#0b3d91;--accent:#f57c00;--bg:#f0f4fa}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:#222}
header{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:var(--main);color:#fff;padding:12px 25px}
header nav a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;transition:color .3s}
header nav a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:70px 20px;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0b3d91,#1976d2);animation:fade 1.2s ease}
.hero h1{font-size:2.4rem;margin:0 0 10px}
.hero a{display:inline-block;margin-top:15px;padding:12px 28px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:30px;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .3s}
.hero a:hover{transform:scale(1.08)}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:22px;max-width:1100px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 20px}
.card{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #dde;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.08);transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-8px);box-shadow:0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.18)}
.card .icon{font-size:42px}
.card h3{color:var(--main);margin:10px 0}
.card a{color:var(--accent);font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none}
footer{background:#082a66;color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:18px;margin-top:30px}
@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-20px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
@media(max-width:600px){
header{flex-direction:column}
header nav a{margin:6px 8px;display:inline-block}
.hero h1{font-size:1.7rem}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h2>MRU Student Services</h2>
<nav>
<a href="#">Home</a>
<a href="#services">Services</a>
<a href="#">Contact</a>
</nav>
</header>

<section class="hero">
<h1>Everything a Student Needs, in One Place</h1>
<p>Quick access to library, transport, hostel, placements and examinations.</p>
<a href="#services">Explore Services</a>
</section>

<section class="grid" id="services">
<div class="card">
<div class="icon">📚</div>
<h3>Library</h3>
<p>Catalogue, e-books and timings.</p>
<a href="#">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🚌</div>
<h3>Transport</h3>
<p>Bus routes and schedules.</p>
<a href="#">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">🏠</div>
<h3>Hostel</h3>
<p>Rules, allotment and mess menu.</p>
<a href="#">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">💼</div>
<h3>Placements</h3>
<p>Drives, training and results.</p>
<a href="#">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">📝</div>
<h3>Examinations</h3>
<p>Timetables, hall tickets, results.</p>
<a href="#">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">❓</div>
<h3>Helpdesk</h3>
<p>Raise queries and get support.</p>
<a href="#">Open</a>
</div>
</section>

<footer>
&copy; 2026 Malla Reddy University | studentservices@mru.edu.in
</footer>
</body>
</html>
